  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "PeerSharp 5.3.0 guards tracker, web seed and magnet xs requests against server-side request forgery (new Connection.SsrfMitigation, on by default for this device), stops a tokenless loopback stream server from allowing cross-origin reads, and greatly speeds up downloading from and seeding to fast peers. v2-only torrents now seed the last piece of every file, a start over files already on disk checks them instead of downloading them again, and rechecks hash several pieces at once. SSL torrents take a certificate after they are added (ITorrent.SetSslCertificateAsync) and report ITorrent.IsSsl. Blocklists load six times faster, read zero-padded addresses as decimal rather than octal, and accept eMule DAT lists. Binary compatible with 5.2.0. See https://github.com/ligenq/PeerSharp/blob/v5.3.0/CHANGELOG.md.",
